1
00:00:00,159 --> 00:00:03,359
This is the only part of the caravan that no one ever checks.

2
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:07,639
This is a caravan roof cover, six point five by three meters.

3
00:00:07,779 --> 00:00:10,239
It only covers the roof, not the entire caravan.

4
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:13,119
No heavy tarp to pull over by yourself in the wind.

5
00:00:13,199 --> 00:00:15,880
The fabric is made of heavy-duty 210 D weave.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:22,239
It holds up against rain, snow, and sun all winter long outside. You secure it with straps and a drawstring along the edge.

7
00:00:22,299 --> 00:00:24,719
It stays in place even when it's really windy.

8
00:00:24,819 --> 00:00:26,759
One person can handle it on their own.

9
00:00:26,859 --> 00:00:28,719
No one needs to hold the other end.

10
00:00:28,739 --> 00:00:32,479
When not in use, it folds up into the included storage bag.

11
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:34,279
Takes up no space in the awning box.

12
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:37,639
A simple way to protect the most expensive surface on the caravan.
